      "guid": null,
      "name": "HANAVI's AIO",
      "slug": "hanavis-aio",
      "teaser": "a AIO mod, some guns RPM Rebalanced and have Full Auto, some additional modding, and.. something more",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2408.png",
      "downloads": 6654,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>BUG REFORT &gt;&gt; WRITE COMMANT PLEASE</p>\n<p>its my first AIO mod!</p>\n<p>you can turn off at config</p>\n<p>1. AR firerate change (Assult Rifle + Assult carbine)<br />\nAK-101: 650rpm &gt; 700rpm<br />\nAK-102: 600rpm &gt; 675rpm<br />\nAK-103: 600rpm &gt; 625rpm<br />\nAK-104: 600rpm &gt; 625rpm<br />\nAK-105: 600rpm &gt; 675rpm<br />\nAK-74M: 650rpm &gt; 700rpm<br />\nRPK-16: 650rpm &gt; 725rpm<br />\nAK-12: 700rpm &gt; 750rpm<br />\nAK-74 series: 650rpm &gt; 675rpm<br />\nVPO-215: add Full-Auto, 550rpm<br />\nVPO-209: add Full-Auto, 450rpm<br />\nAK 545 series: add Full-Auto, 625rpm<br />\nRD-704: 600rpm &gt; 650rpm</p>\n<p>Mk.47: 650rpm &gt; 675rpm<br />\nSCAR-L: 650rpm &gt; 700rpm<br />\nSCAR-H: 600rpm &gt; 650rpm<br />\nMDR 5.56: 650rpm &gt; 675rpm<br />\nAUG A3: 715rpm &gt; 725rpm<br />\nADAR 2-15: add Full-Auto, 600rpm<br />\nTX-15: add Full-Auto, 700rpm<br />\nVSK-94: 900rpm &gt; 850rpm<br />\n9A-91: 900rpm &gt; 850rpm<br />\nXM7 (MCX Spear): 700rpm &gt; 750rpm</p>\n<p>2. SMG firerate change<br />\nVector 9x19: 950rpm &gt;1200rpm<br />\nUMP-45: 600rpm &gt; 700rpm<br />\nPP-19-01 Vityaz: 700rpm &gt; 750rpm<br />\nSR-2 Veresk: 950rpm &gt; 900rpm<br />\nSTM-9: add Full-Auto, 775rpm</p>\n<p>Saiga-9: add Full-Auto, 700rpm</p>\n<p>3. DMR firerate change</p>\n<p>VSS Vintorez: 900rpm &gt; 875rpm<br />\nM1A: add Full-Auto, 700rpm - now M1A is M14 lol</p>\n<p>SR-25: add Full-Auto, 675rpm<br />\nG28: add Full-Auto, 600rpm - now G28 is HK417 lol</p>\n<p>RSASS: add Full-Auto, 600rpm</p>\n<p>4. Shotgun firerate change</p>\n<p>Saiga-12: add Full-Auto, 600rpm</p>\n<p>5. Toygun Rework</p>\n<p>add 1000-round mags, (Recoil -30)</p>\n<p>add Gen2 Carbon Disk Ammo (Damage 5, Penetration 100, Ammo Speed 500m/s, Recoil -30)</p>\n<p>6. VPO-215 can use 7.62x39mm M43 Ammo</p>\n<p>7. ADAR 2-15 can use .300 BLK Ammo</p>\n<p>8. SKS Series can use .366 TKM Ammo</p>\n<p>9. STM-9 can use .45 ACP Ammo</p>\n<p>10. PPSh-41 Tactical kit<br />\nnow can use scope, muzzle units, and Ultima Stocks</p>\n<p>11. KS-23M Tactical kit<br />\nnow can use Mk-14 Stocks and some Stock mounts, some handghards, and scopes, and muzzle units</p>\n<p>12. RPD Tactical Kit</p>\n<p>now can use some… PKP parts and some.. scope mounts.. etc</p>\n<p>13. VSS 6P29M mount can use WMX200 Flashlight</p>\n<p>14. G28 can use AR-15 Stock tubes</p>\n<p>15. DVL-10 660mm long barrel can use muzzle units</p>\n<p>16. Super Plates</p>\n<p>all plates now Aramid, and has Durability 50</p>\n<p>17. Mounts not have Extrasize<br />\n* sorry for error. I was named this option “Super Side Plates”.. it will reworks soon.</p>\n<p>18. Planting Quest Items can insert Dogtag case<br />\n* only SPEC items. ex.. MX2000 etc</p>\n<p>19. using .223 stanag guns can use G36 mags<br />\nits.. just Pretty</p>\n<p>20. SCAR-H can use some .308 mags</p>\n<p>21. using .308 stanag guns can use MK17 mags</p>\n<p>22. MP5K can use MP5 Stocks</p>\n<p>23. some scope mounts can use tactical units</p>\n<p>24. AR-P.E.P.R can use all 30mm mounts</p>\n<p>25. backup iron sight back slot can use MPR45 canted mount</p>\n<p>26. TT-01 mount can use MPR45 mount</p>\n<p>27. some shotguns and smgs can use scopes</p>\n<p>its mean.. um.. ex) mp7 + 34mm scope etc</p>\n<p>28. bit dt mount can use more sights</p>\n<p>29. SVT-40 can use more scopes</p>\n<p>original bundle file for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2322-vinihns-little-addons-3-9-port/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ViniHNS Little Addons</a></p>\n<p>thx for view my mods</p>\n",
